      "<a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"min-w-0 transition-colors duration-200 hover:no-underline\" href=\"https://blog.nandan.dev/what-i-built-in-the-last-year-a-list-of-failures?utm_source=hashnode&amp;utm_medium=feed\"><h3 id=\"_R_4icqluatb_\" class=\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground line-clamp-2 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-primary sm:text-xl\">What I Built in the Last Year: A List of Failures</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\">A list of failures.\nThat's the most accurate title I could come up with. Here's the summary:\nIn the last year or so, I have built 4 web apps, 3 open-source tools, wrote one book, onboarded 250+ users </p></a>",
      "<a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"shrink-0\" aria-label=\"What I Built in the Last Year: A List of Failures\" href=\"https://blog.nandan.dev/what-i-built-in-the-last-year-a-list-of-failures?utm_source=hashnode&amp;utm_medium=feed\"><div class=\"group/cover relative aspect-[800/420] w-28 overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-muted sm:w-36 md:w-44\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/cover:scale-105 motion-reduce:transform-none\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.hashnode.com/uploads/covers/628769bf89168247f55ee8b0/5656449c-e499-4e17-9674-dfe635acc07f.png?w=800&amp;h=420&amp;auto=compress,format&amp;format=webp\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl ring-1 ring-inset ring-black/10 dark:ring-white/10\"></div></div></a>",
      "<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"truncate text-sm text-muted-foreground transition hover:text-foreground\" href=\"https://kbentis.cloud/how-much-of-your-intune-tenant-is-deploying-to-nobody?utm_source=hashnode&amp;utm_medium=feed\">kbentis.cloud</a>",
